    ARCHITECTURAL NOTE: At 1650 ps this path cannot close in
    1 cycle at 1 GHz. The RTL handles this via idle-cycle refresh:
    safe_min is updated only when no admission is in flight.
    A 2-cycle multicycle_path constraint resolves this cleanly.
    Alternatively, pipeline the tree (split at Level 3).

